[2s]
Well, I didn't write that either,
but I did write this handy little
"VHS pre-processor" which makes it
really easy to write engaging VHS scripts, or "tapes",
without a lot of the verbose syntax that sometimes
comes along with it.
[1s]
It's called "pre-vhs" and I just released a new
major version of it this week.

Even if you don't like it that much, I still
highly recommend VHS.

